    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26194" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφαύσκω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		 (and later Prose, <i><span class="en">
			D.H.
			9.63
		</span></i>) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-φώσκω,</span>
		aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έφαυσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ge.</u>
					44.3
				</span></i>
			, al.:—<i>show light through, dawn,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμ᾽ ἡμέρῃ διαφωσκούσῃ</span> as soon
			as day <i>began to dawn,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.45
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτι διαφαύσκοντος</span>
			(abs.) <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				31.14.13
			</span></i>.</div>
